/*
 * Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ — Dual Sensor Environmental Logger
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - BH1750 ambient light sensor  -> I2C bus 1 (GPIO2/3), address 0x10
 *   - MAX4466 analog microphone    -> MCP3008 channel 0 (SPI0 CE0)
