 * SDP810-500Pa differential pressure & temperature logger for Raspberry Pi 4 Model B.
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   SDP810 SDA  -> GPIO2 (pin 3, I2C bus 1 SDA)
 *   SDP810 SCL  -> GPIO3 (pin 5, I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   SDP810 VDD  -> 3.3 V
