/*
 * Flame sensor monitor for Raspberry Pi 5 (RPi 5).
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - Keyes KY-026 flame sensor (active-low digital output)
 *   - Sensor DO -> GPIO 4 (BCM)
 *   - Sensor VCC -> 3.3 V (pin 1)
 *   - Sensor GND -> GND (pin 9)
 *
 * Build:
 *   gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o flame_monitor flame_monitor.c -lpigpio -lrt
 *   (pigpio must be installed; run as root or with appropriate permissions.)
