/*
 * MPR121 Capacitive Touch Relay Controller for Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   MPR121 SDA -> GPIO 2 (I2C bus 1 SDA)
 *   MPR121 SCL -> GPIO 3 (I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   MPR121 ADDR -> GND  (I2C address 0x5C)
 *   Relay IN   -> GPIO 17 (BCM)
 *   Relay VCC  -> 5V
 *   Relay GND  -> GND
 *
 * Behavior:
 *   - Polls all 12 electrodes every 50 ms.
 *   - Relay is HIGH when any electrode is touched, LOW when all are released.
 *   - Every relay state change is logged to relay_log.txt with a timestamp.
 *   - Clean shutdown on SIGINT.
